{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26858","headline":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 泛觞泉 · 姚合","name":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 泛觞泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不上酒家楼，池边日献酬。\n杯来转巴字，客坐遶方流。\n酹滴苔纹断，泉连石岸秋。\n若能山下置，岁晚愿同游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}